                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.348 Z 4/47: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Belgium</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Fletcher</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Brussels</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-10-01T13:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 1,
                                1923—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received October 1—10:24
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>113. Department’s unnumbered instructions September 18th last. Minister of
                    Foreign Affairs states Belgian Government will grant desired permission for
                    passage of airship mentioned over Belgian territory.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
